  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the warmth of the holiday season with this customizable Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully printed winter design of a realistic cardinal perched on a branch within a pine wreath, this cozy bedding layer brings a festive touch of nature to your bedroom, guest room, or vacation home. Perfect for Christmas gifting or everyday winter comfort, you can easily personalize it to create a thoughtful keepsake for bird lovers.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features options to add custom text or your name to the quilt for a unique, personalized touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Comfort:</strong> Crafted with a soft, breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth and comfort in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your bedding set by choosing to add matching printed pillowcases in your preferred quantity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional design can be used as a bed quilt, a cozy throw blanket, a picnic mat, or a comfortable companion for camping trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and quick-drying, allowing it to easily fluff back up to its cozy state.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Couple Red Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Patchwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (102x91 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
